## 🛡️ Google Play Console Security

### 1. Play App Signing

* Protects from APK tampering.
* Automatically signs builds uploaded to Play.

### 2. Play Integrity API

```kotlin
val request = IntegrityTokenRequest.builder()
    .setNonce(UUID.randomUUID().toString())
    .build()

integrityManager.requestIntegrityToken(request)
    .addOnSuccessListener { response ->
        val token = response.token()
        // Send to server for verification
    }
```

### 3. SQLCipher Integration

```kotlin
val passphrase = SQLiteDatabase.getBytes("secure".toCharArray())
val factory = SupportFactory(passphrase)
Room.databaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java, "secure.db")
    .openHelperFactory(factory)
    .build()
```

